  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "055cc6a846f7cf58",
      "translationZh": "Unitree Robotics 发布了 UnifoLM-WLA-1.0，这是他们新发布的通用人形基础模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6e4facf3c485e940",
      "translationZh": "• 在约 2,500 小时的真实机器人数据上进行训练",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c249ccdf49e03f24",
      "translationZh": "• 一个模型可处理 64 项任务（10 项全身任务 + 54 项桌面任务）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78a3fbddf6453b0c",
      "translationZh": "• 支持平行夹爪和两种不同的灵巧手",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f994eb57f36b57cf",
      "translationZh": "• 具备强大的空间推理能力（在具身基准测试中优于许多开源模型）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "36a8e93bf50553f6",
      "translationZh": "架构很有趣：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c07d6dd60b4f79ad",
      "translationZh": "• 以 UnifoLM-ER-1 为起点（基于 Qwen3-VL 的具身推理器）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a0da76087db6dff",
      "translationZh": "• 通过光流 + VQ-VAE 添加未来动态区域预测",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "265b6ed6cb1694a3",
      "translationZh": "• 使用残差 VQ 将动作离散化（末端执行器 + 手 + 下肢）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "861012a7a3ca8849",
      "translationZh": "• 然后在顶部添加一个 MMDiT 动作专家以实现连续控制",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5075e9b7fd4cfa7c",
      "translationZh": "他们展示它在 Unitree G1 上运行，做诸如整理床铺、装载洗衣机、折叠衣物、分类物体等事情。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d287e18142908c4",
      "translationZh": "看来这是目前为止最完整的开放式尝试之一，旨在实现真正的全身 VLA。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "55210664e00808ca",
      "translationZh": "你们觉得这是实际进展还是只是另一个炫酷的演示？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52bcf1e239c69e90",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/WebAssemblyMan 提交",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
